Input: {"question": "When was the Simeon Smith House built?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d00", "start": 0, "end": 9, "text": "Simeon P."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d00", "start": 10, "end": 35, "text": "Smith House The Simeon P."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d00", "start": 36, "end": 116, "text": "Smith House is a historic house at 154 High Street in Portsmouth, New Hampshire."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d00", "start": 117, "end": 292, "text": "Built in 1810-11, it is a fine example of a Federal-style duplex, built for a local craftsman, and one of a modest number of such houses to survive a devastating fire in 1813."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d00", "start": 293, "end": 372, "text": "It was listed on the National Register of Historic Places on November 14, 1972."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d00", "start": 373, "end": 386, "text": "The Simeon P."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d00", "start": 387, "end": 540, "text": "Smith House is located on The Hill, a cluster of historic properties south of Deer and High streets which was created as part of a road widening project."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d00", "start": 541, "end": 543, "text": "It"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d01", "start": 0, "end": 9, "text": "Simeon P."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d01", "start": 10, "end": 35, "text": "Smith House The Simeon P."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0448-71f44b761912:d01", "start": 36, "end": 116, "text": "Smith House is a historic house at 154 High Street in Portsmouth, New Hampshire."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id"